0 recent:gift => gazette.news.gifts cat=gazette tag=wholesome :: A steady stream of small gifts has been seen around the village this week. Nobody will say who is behind it. Everybody knows.
0 recent:quest => gazette.news.errands cat=gazette tag=wholesome :: A good week for favors. A job was finished, a promise kept, and a neighbor said thank you out loud.
0 recent:skill => gazette.news.practice cat=gazette tag=wholesome :: Practice paid off for somebody this week. Calloused hands were seen. The village approves.
0 recent:scene => gazette.news.moment cat=gazette tag=wholesome :: Something happened in the village this week that people are still talking about. Details are being improved with each telling.

